Replace YOUR-GITHUB-USERNAME and YOUR-EMAIL with your real details:
{
    "owner": {
        "username": "YOUR-GITHUB-USERNAME",
        "email": "YOUR-EMAIL"
    },
    "records": {
        "CNAME": "YOUR-GITHUB-USERNAME.github.io"
    }
}
Example if your username is marie:
{
    "owner": {
        "username": "marie",
        "email": "marie@gmail.com"
    },
    "records": {
        "CNAME": "marie.github.io"
    }
}
